# Plan Mode File Path Handling — Research Report

All paths are under `/workspace/repo`.

## 1. `validatePlanPath` function

**File:** `packages/core/src/utils/planUtils.ts` (lines 32–50)

**Signature:** `validatePlanPath(planPath: string, plansDir: string): Promise<string | null>`

Note: the JSDoc references a `targetDir` param (line 29) that no longer exists in the signature — stale doc.

```ts
export async function validatePlanPath(
  planPath: string,
  plansDir: string,
): Promise<string | null> {
  const safeFilename = path.basename(planPath);
  const resolvedPath = path.join(plansDir, safeFilename);
  const realPath = resolveToRealPath(resolvedPath);
  const realPlansDir = resolveToRealPath(plansDir);

  if (!isSubpath(realPlansDir, realPath)) {
    return PlanErrorMessages.PATH_ACCESS_DENIED(planPath, realPlansDir);
  }

  if (!(await fileExists(resolvedPath))) {
    return PlanErrorMessages.FILE_NOT_FOUND(planPath);
  }

  return null;
}
```

The same file also defines `PlanErrorMessages` (lines 15–23) and `validatePlanContent(planPath: string): Promise<string | null>` (lines 57–69).

**Only non-test caller:** `packages/core/src/tools/exit-plan-mode.ts` (imported line 22; called at line 122 with `this.config.storage.getPlansDir()`; `validatePlanContent` at line 131).

## 2. `Config` class and project-root methods

**File:** `packages/core/src/config/config.ts`
- `export interface ConfigParameters` at line 579
- `export class Config implements McpContext, AgentLoopContext` at line 731
- `readonly storage: Storage;` at line 882
- Storage wired up in constructor (lines 1271–1272):
  ```ts
  this.storage = new Storage(this.targetDir, this._sessionId);
  this.storage.setCustomPlansDir(params.planSettings?.directory);
  ```

**Relevant methods (lines 2040–2050):**
```ts
getTargetDir(): string {
  return this.targetDir;
}

getProjectRoot(): string {
  return this.targetDir;
}

getWorkspaceContext(): WorkspaceContext {
  return getWorkspaceContextOverride() ?? this.workspaceContext;
}
```
- `getWorkingDir(): string` at line 2793.
- `_initialize()` (lines 1405–1425) adds the plans dir to the workspace context when `planEnabled`:
  ```ts
  if (this.planEnabled) {
    const plansDir = this.storage.getPlansDir();
    try {
      await fs.promises.access(plansDir);
      this.workspaceContext.addDirectory(plansDir);
    } catch { /* created on first plan write */ }
  }
  ```

## 3. `packages/core/src/utils/paths.ts`

Full contents (499 lines). Exports relevant to plan-path handling:
- `GEMINI_DIR = '.gemini'` (line 13)
- `getProjectHash(projectRoot)` (line 317)
- `normalizePath(p)` (line 327)
- `isSubpath(parentPath, childPath): boolean` (lines 344–370) — resolves both to absolute, case-insensitive on Windows/Darwin, returns true only if child is within parent.
- `isValidPathString` / `assertValidPathString` (lines 375–386)
- `resolveToRealPath(pathStr): string` (lines 397–412) — strips `file://`, decodes URI, resolves symlinks via `robustRealpath` (lines 414–456, which handles ENOENT/EISDIR by resolving parents so non-existent paths still resolve).
- `deduplicateAbsolutePaths`, `toPathKey`, `makeRelative`, `shortenPath`, `escapePath`, `unescapePath`, `tildeifyPath`, `homedir`, `tmpdir`.

`planUtils.ts` imports `isSubpath` and `resolveToRealPath` from this file.

## 4. AI-facing prompt text about ".md plan files" / plans directory

**File `packages/core/src/prompts/snippets.ts`** — `renderPlanningWorkflow(options)` (lines 565–615). Key lines using `${options.plansDir}/`:
- Line 572: goal "produce an implementation plan in `${options.plansDir}/`"
- Line 581: Rule 1 "you can only write to `${options.plansDir}/`"
- Line 582: Rule 2 "`WRITE_FILE` and `EDIT` **may ONLY be used to write .md plan files to** `${options.plansDir}/`. They cannot modify source code."
- Line 587: "Save plans as Markdown (.md) using descriptive filenames."
- Line 606: "Write the implementation plan to `${options.plansDir}/`."
- `PlanningWorkflowOptions` interface defined at lines 100–105 (`plansDir: string`).

**File `packages/core/src/prompts/snippets.legacy.ts`** — `## Plan Storage` section (lines 445–448):
- Line 446: "Save your plans as Markdown (.md) files ONLY within: `${options.plansDir}/`"
- Lines 442–443 list WRITE_FILE / EDIT as "Save/Update plans to the plans directory". `plansDir` field in options at line 97.

**File `packages/core/src/prompts/promptProvider.ts`** — the `planningWorkflow` section builder (lines 193–202) supplies `plansDir: context.config.storage.getPlansDir()` and `approvedPlanPath: context.config.getApprovedPlanPath()`.

## 5. Write-file tool and edit tool plan-mode handling

Both redirect writes to the plans dir when in plan mode, using only `path.basename` of the requested file path.

**`packages/core/src/tools/write-file.ts`** (lines 170–181):
```ts
if (this.config.isPlanMode()) {
  const safeFilename = path.basename(this.params.file_path);
  this.resolvedPath = path.join(
    this.config.storage.getPlansDir(),
    safeFilename,
  );
} else {
  this.resolvedPath = path.resolve(
    this.config.getTargetDir(),
    this.params.file_path,
  );
}
```

**`packages/core/src/tools/edit.ts`** (lines 467–485):
```ts
if (this.config.isPlanMode()) {
  const safeFilename = path.basename(this.params.file_path);
  this.resolvedPath = path.join(
    this.config.storage.getPlansDir(),
    safeFilename,
  );
} else if (!path.isAbsolute(this.params.file_path)) {
  const result = correctPath(this.params.file_path, this.config);
  if (result.success) {
    this.resolvedPath = result.correctedPath;
  } else {
    this.resolvedPath = path.resolve(
      this.config.getTargetDir(),
      this.params.file_path,
    );
  }
} else {
  this.resolvedPath = this.params.file_path;
}
```

## 6. Where `plansDir` is defined/computed and how it's passed around

**Definition/computation — `Storage.getPlansDir()`** in `packages/core/src/config/storage.ts` (lines 323–341):
```ts
getPlansDir(): string {
  if (this.customPlansDir) {
    const resolvedPath = path.resolve(
      this.getProjectRoot(),
      this.customPlansDir,
    );
    const realProjectRoot = resolveToRealPath(this.getProjectRoot());
    const realResolvedPath = resolveToRealPath(resolvedPath);

    if (!isSubpath(realProjectRoot, realResolvedPath)) {
      throw new Error(
        `Custom plans directory '${this.customPlansDir}' resolves to '${realResolvedPath}', which is outside the project root '${realProjectRoot}'.`,
      );
    }
    return resolvedPath;
  }
  return this.getProjectTempPlansDir();
}
```

Supporting pieces in the same file:
- `Storage.getProjectRoot()` → returns `this.targetDir` (lines 198–200).
- `getProjectTempPlansDir()` (lines 309–314): session-scoped `<tempDir>/<sessionId>/plans` or `<tempDir>/plans`.
- `getProjectTempDir()` (lines 169–173): global temp dir joined with the per-project identifier.
- `customPlansDir` field (line 34), set via `setCustomPlansDir(dir)` (lines 41–43), called from Config constructor with `params.planSettings?.directory`.

**Callers / how it's passed around** (all call `config.storage.getPlansDir()`):
- `packages/core/src/config/config.ts:1415` — adds to workspace context.
- `packages/core/src/prompts/promptProvider.ts:198` — into prompt `plansDir`.
- `packages/core/src/tools/write-file.ts:173` and `packages/core/src/tools/edit.ts:470` — redirect writes.
- `packages/core/src/tools/exit-plan-mode.ts:64,66,124,174,183` — validation & approval (line 64 wraps it in `resolveToRealPath`).
- `packages/core/src/tools/enter-plan-mode.ts:131`.
- `packages/core/src/tools/tool-registry.ts:637`.
- `packages/core/src/hooks/hookRunner.ts:351` (sets `GEMINI_PLANS_DIR` env var) and `:521`.
